AmiRocket release documentation

The distributable Aminet-style ReadMe is generated from VERSION and CHANGELOG.md
by scripts/make-aminet-release.py during scripts/build-amiga.sh. Its build output
is build/amiga/AmiRocket.readme and it appears as ReadMe in the runtime package.

See AmiRocket.guide for installation, updates, use and removal, and RELEASING.md
for the build-once/check/prepare/publish workflow. AmiRocket is licensed under
GPL-3.0-or-later; see the repository LICENSE and COPYRIGHT files.
